description:
Lists the links the reader has drawn between their own saved quotes in ReadingRate, newest first: the two quotes each link joins, with book and page, and the reader's line on why they belong together. Can be narrowed to the links of one quote, and can include links suggested to the reader that they have not accepted yet.

Use when the reader asks what a quote is linked to, which quotes they have connected, or before suggesting a link, to avoid suggesting one they already have.

Example: {"quote_id": "<quote id>"}
